      "content": "### Direct Current (DC) Motors - Full Load Amps"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Important Notes\n\n**Motor Load Ranges:**\n- Acceptable for short-period: 20 - 120%\n- Acceptable for operating: 50 - 100%\n- Optimum efficiency: 60 - 80%\n\nMost electric motors are designed to run at 50% to 100% of rated load with maximum efficiency usually near 75% of rated load.\n\n**Unit Conversion:**\n- 1 hp = 745.7 W = 0.746 kW = 550 ft·lb/s = 2,545 Btu/h = 33,000 ft·lb/m = 1.0139 metric horsepower ≈ 1.0 kVA\n\n**For 115V DC motors:** The amps is twice the amps for 230V"
